{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "devsecurex-simple-working",
  "title": "DevSecureX - Simple Working Dashboard",
  "description": "Basic working dashboard with real DevSecureX metrics",
  "tags": ["devsecurex", "working", "simple"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": "-- Grafana --",
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "DevSecureX Backend Status",
      "type": "stat",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "up{job=\"devsecurex-backend\"}",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "Backend Status",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-uid"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "DOWN"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "UP"
                }
              },
              "type": "value"
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "steps": [
              {"color": "red", "value": 0},
              {"color": "green", "value": 1}
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 0}
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "System Health Score",
      "type": "stat",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "system_health_score{job=\"devsecurex-backend\"}",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "Health Score",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-uid"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "steps": [
              {"color": "red", "value": 0},
              {"color": "yellow", "value": 50},
              {"color": "green", "value": 80}
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 0}
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Active Database Queries",
      "type": "stat",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "db_active_queries_current{job=\"devsecurex-backend\"}",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "Active Queries",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-uid"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "steps": [
              {"color": "green", "value": 0},
              {"color": "yellow", "value": 10},
              {"color": "red", "value": 50}
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 0}
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Scaling Target Workers",
      "type": "stat",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "scaling_target_workers{job=\"devsecurex-backend\"}",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "Target Workers",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-uid"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "steps": [
              {"color": "blue", "value": 0},
              {"color": "green", "value": 1},
              {"color": "yellow", "value": 5},
              {"color": "red", "value": 10}
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 0}
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Backend Uptime History",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "up{job=\"devsecurex-backend\"}",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "Backend Up",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-uid"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "insertNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "pointSize": 5,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            },
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "hideFrom": {
              "legend": false,
              "tooltip": false,
              "vis": false
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none"
        },
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 8}
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Database Activity Over Time",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "db_active_queries_current{job=\"devsecurex-backend\"}",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "Active Queries",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-uid"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "insertNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "pointSize": 5,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            },
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "hideFrom": {
              "legend": false,
              "tooltip": false,
              "vis": false
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none"
        },
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 8}
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Available Metrics Summary",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {"h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 16},
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Available DevSecureX Metrics\n\nThis dashboard shows **real data** from your DevSecureX backend. Here are the key metrics currently available:\n\n- **Backend Status**: Shows if the backend service is up and running\n- **System Health Score**: Current health score (0-100)\n- **Active Database Queries**: Number of currently executing database queries\n- **Scaling Target Workers**: Target number of workers for scaling\n\n### To verify metrics are working:\n1. Check that \"Backend Status\" shows \"UP\"\n2. Observe database activity as you use the application\n3. Monitor system health score changes\n\n### Next steps:\n- Add more panels as you generate application traffic\n- Create alerts for when backend goes down\n- Monitor specific endpoints once HTTP metrics are collected"
      }
    }
  ]
}